      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Shifting 规则",
      "items": [
        "shifting 下未选中项只留图标，选中项把标题与图标按 150ms 动画展开（BottomBarTab L406-431）",
        "加宽量取自 resizeTabsToCorrectSizes 预算的 activeShiftingItemWidth（BottomBar L395-396）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "选中回调",
      "items": [
        "handleClick 先问 TabSelectionInterceptor，返回 true 就吞掉这次切换（BottomBar L913-919）",
        "位置变化触发 onTabSelectListener，同位置再点触发 onTabReselectListener（L944-960）"
      ]
    }
